# Defender prevents attacking; sacrificing the Wall produces exactly two red mana (CR 702.3b, 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Tinder Wall
Memnite
Forest
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tinder Wall.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T3 Bot1.Attackers]
! Bot1.Attack(Tinder Wall > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Tinder Wall.Activate(Ability: Add {R}{R})
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Tinder Wall.Power = 0
